# Vercel auto-deploys main. Only the site itself is deployed; everything else in the repo (qa/, docs/,
# scripts/, supabase/, README.md) stays on GitHub and is never served from dr-mumbo-jumbo.com.
# Ignore everything at the root, then allow the site back in:
/*
!api
!lib
!*.html
!fightpack.js
!sample-kit.json
!nocturne.css
!og.png
!favicon.svg
!logo-mark.svg
!apple-touch-icon.png
!icon-512.png
!robots.txt
!vercel.json
